[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one issue, one fix queued. Read report by report,
it holds three problems. The queued parser fix closes only the first one.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. Each problem below has its own ticket. Shipping the parser fix leaves the other two open.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
